    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Professor Marleen Temmerman, a distinguished leader in women and girls' health and rights, is set to receive the prestigious title of 'Commander in the Order of Leopold' from His Majesty King Philippe of Belgium. This esteemed honour recognizes Professor Temmerman's exceptional contributions to the field of women and girls' health, equity and rights.",
